{
  "$comment": "Every code of the Forms+ error envelope (DESIGN.md 3.4): HTTP status, default English message for the DMS pages (classic and dms-ui show it when they have nothing better), and what a client may do next. `reconnect`: the UI offers \"Reconnect to DMS\". `retryable`: the same request, repeated unchanged, may succeed. The envelope is {success:false, code, message, details?, request_id}; request_id is the X-Request-Id header when it is a UUID, else a new one. Existing legacy shapes (HTTP 200 success:false validation, 404 ALREADY_EXISTS) are not part of this contract (BD-04). An unknown code is shown with `genericMessage`.",
  "contract": "fp-errors",
  "version": 1,
  "genericMessage": "Something went wrong. Try again, and give the reference to your administrator if it keeps failing.",
  "codes": [
    {
      "code": "FP_ORIGIN_DENIED",
      "status": 403,
      "message": "Forms+ cannot be opened from here.",
      "reconnect": false,
      "retryable": false
    },
    {
      "code": "FP_TICKET_CHANNEL_DENIED",
      "status": 403,
      "message": "Forms+ cannot be opened from here.",
      "reconnect": false,
      "retryable": false
    },
    {
      "code": "WORKSPACE_FORBIDDEN",
      "status": 403,
      "message": "You are not a member of this workspace.",
      "reconnect": false,
      "retryable": false
    },
    {
      "code": "FORBIDDEN_RIGHT",
      "status": 403,
